LLD Question: Design a Parking Lot

Design a Parking Lot System that manages parking for different types of vehicles.

Functional Requirements
The parking lot can have multiple floors.
Each floor has multiple parking spots.
There are different vehicle types:
Bike
Car
Truck
Parking spots can also be of different types:
Bike spot
Car spot
Truck spot
When a vehicle enters:
Find an appropriate available parking spot.
Assign the spot to the vehicle.
Generate a parking ticket.
When a vehicle exits:
Calculate the parking fee.
Accept payment.
Free the parking spot.
The system should be able to show available parking spots.
Different vehicle types may have different parking fees.

Entities :

Vehicle, ParkingLot, ParkingFloors, ParkingSpot, Ticket, Payment